# 1.1.intake.capture.stone

## .what

capture the raw history verbatim — the owner's words, the timeline of events, the reported effect —
with no interpretation yet. this is the ground the whole route stands on.

## .inputs

- `0.seed.md` — the verbatim input + event ledger

## .do

- transcribe the reported effect(s), exposures, and timeline exactly as stated
- preserve the owner's own words for later re-read (do not paraphrase away detail)
- redact identity to a persona handle (`rule.forbid.pii`)
- note the source of each datum (owner-reported vs observed vs record)

## .emit

into `1.1.intake.capture.yield.md`.

## .done when

the verbatim history + timeline is captured, PII-safe, with each datum's source marked.
